{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49893","headline":"後庭宴 · 无名氏","name":"後庭宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千里故乡，十年华屋，乱魂飞过屏山簇。\n眼重眉褪不胜春，菱花知我销香玉。\n双双燕子归来，应解笑人幽独。\n断歌零舞，遗恨清江曲。\n万树绿低迷，一庭红{艹/扑}𫂙","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49893.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49893","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}